# The repository root ignores *.png (the fitness app's screenshots, and qa/shots/ here).
# The PWA icons are build OUTPUT that dist/ has to carry: a manifest that names an icon the
# repository does not hold is an install that shows a blank tile. They are re-included here.
# qa/shots/*.png stays ignored — those are screenshots, not artefacts.
!dist/*.png

# Python bytecode caches are build output of running the suites, never source (one was committed by accident in e42edb2).
__pycache__/
